# Golden G-M3-1: the first WOW — a functional progression, looped, then
# transposed WHILE LOOPING. | ii V | in C major plays Dm7 G7; after
# 'seq transpose to G' the SAME degrees re-derive (D28): Am7 D7.
key C major
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth
seq new verse
seq add D 1bar
seq add G 1bar
seq loop on
seq play
transport start
advance 7679
seq transpose to G major
advance 7680
transport stop
quit
